---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageBanner from '../components/PageBanner.astro';
import { practice } from '../data/practice';

const updated = 'November 17, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | S+ Dental, Mountlake Terrace"
  fullTitle
  breadcrumb="Privacy policy"
  description="How the S+ Dental website and staff tools handle information: no tracking or ads, Google sign-in for staff only, and payments processed by Stripe."
>
  <PageBanner title="Privacy policy" />

  <section class="band legal-text">
    <div class="narrow">
      <p><em>Last updated {updated}</em></p>

      <p>
        This policy covers the {practice.name} website (splus.dental) and our staff tools. It does not
        cover your dental records, which are protected under federal and state health privacy law and
        described in the Notice of Privacy Practices we provide at the office.
      </p>

      <h2>Visiting our website</h2>
      <p>
        We do not use advertising, analytics, or tracking cookies, and we do not sell or share personal
        information. Our hosting provider (Google Firebase) keeps standard technical logs, such as IP
        address and pages requested, to operate and secure the site.
      </p>
      <p>
        Some pages include or link to services run by other companies, which have their own privacy
        policies: an embedded Google Map, appointment booking through Calendly, our Facebook page, and a
        new-patient packet stored on Google Drive.
      </p>

      <h2>Online payments</h2>
      <p>
        When we send you a payment link, the payment is handled by Stripe on Stripe's secure page. Your
        card details go directly to Stripe and never reach our systems. We receive a record of the
        payment (amount, date, and the contact details you enter) so we can apply it to your account.
        Please do not include health information in payment forms.
      </p>

      <h2>Staff sign-in</h2>
      <p>
        Our staff tools use Google sign-in. We receive only the account's name, email address, and
        whether the email is verified, and use them solely to check that the person is authorized
        practice staff. We do not access any other Google account data.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: email <a href={`mailto:${practice.email}`}>{practice.email}</a>{' '}
        or call <a href={`tel:${practice.phone.tel}`}>{practice.phone.display}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-text .narrow {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .legal-text h2 {
    margin-top: 1.6em;
  }
</style>
